G156 -- THE ONTOLOGY DECISION PRE-REGISTRATION: dust = CHARGE (H047) or RELIC (G093/G115)?
==============================================================================================================

  SOURCES: hy4_push/H047 (charge: R(k) = 1, lambda_fs = 0); deepseek G093 (relic window: m >= 3.3-5.7 keV, lambda_fs = 0.50-0.82 Mpc);
